# The shop checkout is a WORKSPACE: everything the setup scripts create
# next to the shop's own files stays out of git — including the
# framework working copy at solid-node/ (its version is the pilot's
# choice: released tag, main, a fork). Each project under projects/
# is its OWN repository (untracked here).
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
playwright-report/
test-results/
# No trailing slash: this must also ignore the framework sprint worktree
# link a cross-repository sprint creates at WTs/sprint-NNN/solid-node,
# which is a symlink rather than a directory.
/solid-node
WTs/
.env
projects/*
!projects/README.md
*.pyc
__pycache__
